---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Framework Systems builds AI-powered automations for local businesses. Based in Tuscumbia, Alabama, serving the Shoals region. We fix your daily headaches with technology that runs 24/7.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-secondary-900 to-secondary-800 text-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">We Fix the Dumb Stuff</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-secondary-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        The repetitive, annoying tasks that eat your day? We make them disappear.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Story Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-6">The One Question That Opens Every Deal</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-6">
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-primary-600">"What's the most annoying part of your day?"</span>
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-6">
            That's it. Not "what's your tech stack." Not "what are your integration requirements." Just: what's the dumbest thing that eats your time?
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-6">
            Every business owner has an answer within 4 seconds. They don't need to think about it because it's the thing that frustrates them every single day.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600">
            We take that answer, open our laptop, and build the fix in front of them. Average time: 5-10 minutes. Their problem disappears. The system runs 24/7. They never touch it.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-secondary-100 rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-6 text-secondary-900">Real Answers We've Heard:</h3>
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-sm text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-1">Pool Company</div>
              <p class="text-secondary-700">"We lose 11 jobs a week because nobody follows up cancellations."</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-sm text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-1">PT Clinic</div>
              <p class="text-secondary-700">"Insurance verification takes 3 hours every morning."</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-sm text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-1">Cleaning Company</div>
              <p class="text-secondary-700">"We quote in 2 days. Our competitor quotes in 2 hours."</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-4 shadow-sm">
              <div class="text-sm text-primary-600 font-semibold mb-1">Dog Groomer</div>
              <p class="text-secondary-700">"I spend 90 minutes every morning calling clients to confirm appointments."</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How We're Different -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-secondary-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4">How We're Different</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-200 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-red-700 mb-6">Traditional Automation Agencies</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-red-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Send proposals, wait weeks for approval
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Quote $12,000-$15,000 for setup
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              6-week delivery timeline
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Manual debugging when things break
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4.293 4.293a1 1 0 011.414 0L10 8.586l4.293-4.293a1 1 0 111.414 1.414L11.414 10l4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L10 11.414l-4.293 4.293a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L8.586 10 4.293 5.707a1 1 0 010-1.414z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              You never see how it's built
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-green-700 mb-6">Framework Systems</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-4 text-green-600">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Build it live in front of you
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              $500-$4,000 typical setup
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Running by end of day
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Self-healing - fixes itself when something breaks
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.707 5.293a1 1 0 010 1.414l-8 8a1 1 0 01-1.414 0l-4-4a1 1 0 011.414-1.414L8 12.586l7.293-7.293a1 1 0 011.414 0z" clip-rule="evenodd"/>
              </svg>
              Watch your problem get solved in real-time
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Tech -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4">The Technology Behind It</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-secondary-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          We use AI to build automations in minutes, not weeks. Here's the stack.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <div class="text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13h18M5 17h14a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">AI-Powered Building</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary-600">We describe your problem in plain English. The AI builds the entire workflow automatically.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Self-Healing</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary-600">When something breaks, the system reads the error, finds the fix, applies it, and re-runs. No manual debugging.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center p-8">
          <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-primary-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3">Instant Deployment</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary-600">From description to running system in under 10 minutes. Test it live. Turn it on immediately.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who We Serve -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-secondary-50">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4">Who We Work With</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-secondary-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Local service businesses in the Shoals region who are tired of losing money to missed calls, no-shows, and manual follow-ups.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">HVAC</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Plumbers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Dentists</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Salons</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Contractors</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Restaurants</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Med Spas</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Clinics</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Cleaners</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Landscapers</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Law Firms</div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-lg text-center">
          <div class="font-semibold text-secondary-900">Auto Shops</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-primary-600 text-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">What's Your Biggest Daily Headache?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-primary-100 mb-8">
        Tell us what's annoying you. We'll fix it in front of you.
      </p>
      <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center bg-white text-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-50 px-8 py-4 rounded-lg font-semibold text-lg transition-colors">
        Schedule Live Demo
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
